@def MICRO_OS_PLUS_MICRO_TEST_PLUS_ENABLED
@brief Enables the µTest++ Testing Framework.

@details
Must be defined by the application, in `micro-os-plus/project-config.h`,
in `micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus-defines.h`, or on the compiler command
line. Without it, `micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus.h` declares nothing and
the library sources compile to nothing.
